{"title":"国家发改委组织召开全国招标投标工作会！部署五方面重点工作！","date":"2024-06-12","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">国家发改委组织召开全国招标投标工作会！</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">部署五方面重点工作！</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">为全面落实党中央、国务院关于招标投标改革创新的部署要求，推动招标投标市场规范健康发展，国家发展改革委近日组织召开全国招标投标工作会，围绕《国务院办公厅关于创新完善体制机制推动招标投标市场规范健康发展的意见》（国办发〔<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>〕<span lang=\"EN-US\">21</span>号）部署近期深化招标投标领域改革创新的任务和举措。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">会议指出，<b>招标投标市场是全国统一大市场和高标准市场体系的重要组成部分</b>。创新完善招标投标体制机制是党中央、国务院作出的重要决策部署，对党和国家事业发展全局具有重要作用，有利于促进新质生产力加快发展，有利于更好发挥投资关键作用，有利于优化营商环境，有利于铲除腐败滋生的土壤。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">会议强调，<b>推进《意见》各项举措落地见效，近期要抓好五方面重点工作</b>：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.05pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">一是规范评标专家管理</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\nmso-ligatures:none\">，通过开展专项清理、完善专家管理制度、建立动态管理机制，切实净化专家队伍；<br />\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\"><!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br />\r\n\t<!--[endif]--></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.05pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">二是严格开展公平竞争审查</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\nmso-ligatures:none\">，按照《招标投标领域公平竞争审查规则》有关要求加快建立工作机制，清理妨碍全国统一大市场建设和公平竞争的规定、做法，纠正以信用评价变相设置交易壁垒问题，优化招标投标营商环境；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.05pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">三是深化全流程电子交易</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\nmso-ligatures:none\">，组织编制全国统一的电子招标投标技术标准和数据规范，全面推行远程异地评标和数字证书（<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>）互认，加快推动系统对接和数据共享；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.05pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">四是严厉打击违法行为</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\nmso-ligatures:none\">，根据案件性质强化线索移送，加大违法行为惩处和曝光力度，形成有效震慑；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.05pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">五是加强协同高效监管</span></b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\nmso-ligatures:none\">，推动招标投标监管向全链条全领域智能监管转变，凝聚监管合力，切实提升监管效能。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">会议强调，各地、各有关部门要提高政治站位，深刻认识创新完善招标投标体制机制的重要性，扭住关键重点，拿出抓铁有痕、踏石留印的韧劲，从强化组织领导、压实主体责任，强化各方协同、汇聚改革合力，强化标本兼治、健全长效机制，强化督促指导、确保落地见效等四个方面发力，以钉钉子精神推进工作，<b>下定决心解决招标投标领域长期以来存在的突出问题，奋力实现招标投标工作新突破，加快形成高效规范、公平竞争、充分开放的招标投标市场</b>，为经济社会平稳健康高质量发展作出更大贡献。</span><br />\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br />\r\n\t<!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>"}